      "html": "<p>The panda cory from the Rio Ucayali in Peru belongs to the most popular species of the genus. This applies both to aquarists who keep a community aquarium and to breeding aquarists, because Corydoras panda is quite easy to breed and productive – if you know how to do it.</p>"
