    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/corydoras-panda-2/",
      "html": "<p>It is really worth keeping these half-grown animals in a larger group, because then they show very nice swarm behaviour.</p>"
    }
